        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "知道，通义千问新出的这个版本嘛，今天早上一打开推特全在刷。我跟你说，这次动静确实不小。",
      "start": 21.337,
      "duration": 7.576,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对对对，你看那个标题写得多狠——\"一张消费级显卡跑出Opus级Agent\"。这话放半年前谁敢信啊？",
      "start": 29.318,
      "duration": 10.754,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，关键信息其实有三个层次。第一，性能上，多项核心基准反超Claude；第二，能跑，单张消费级显卡就能部署；第三，能定制，推理路径可以自己改。这三点叠在一起才是真正要命的。",
      "start": 40.505,
      "duration": 17.26,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航你给我翻译翻译，这跟咱们普通听众到底有啥关系？我看评论区一堆人在喊\"开源赢了\"，这说法靠谱吗？",
      "start": 58.23,
      "duration": 10.362,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这么说吧。过去你想让一个AI帮你做复杂任务链，比如自动订机票、写代码、查资料、生成报告串起来，你基本只能调OpenAI或者Anthropic的API，按token付费，数据还要上他们的云。但现在Qwen3.8-27B这种级别的模型，你买一张高端显卡，自己电脑就能跑，数据全在本地，推理逻辑还能按业务定制——你说这意味着什么？",
      "start": 69.054,
      "duration": 29.688,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "意味着……大模型真正变成\"水电煤\"了？跟当年Linux打掉服务器市场一个逻辑？",
      "start": 99.193,
      "duration": 7.445,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，你这个类比还挺到位的。说白了，云端闭源大模型赚的是信息差和算力垄断的钱。一旦开源阵营在性能上追平甚至反超，这层窗户纸就捅破了。",
      "start": 107.138,
      "duration": 15.867,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我比较好奇的是，这个\"推理能力可自定义\"具体怎么理解？是不是就是改改prompt那么简单？",
      "start": 123.443,
      "duration": 8.011,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "不是prompt层面，是模型本身的推理路径可以干预。你可以理解为，以前的开源模型更像一个成品厨师，给你什么你就吃什么；现在的Qwen3.8-27B更像个开放式厨房，你告诉他今天客人忌口什么、喜欢啥口味，他能重新规划整道菜的流程。",
      "start": 131.915,
      "duration": 21.483,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太实用了吧。那对企业来说，尤其是那种对数据敏感的行业，比如金融、医疗，是不是直接起飞？",
      "start": 153.843,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这类客户之前最大的顾虑就是数据出境和合规。现在本地化部署，性能又不差，等于把最后一层窗户纸也捅了。我估计接下来半年，会有一波中型企业快速把工作流从云端API迁回本地。",
      "start": 163.242,
      "duration": 17.129,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到这儿我倒想吐槽一下OpenAI。你看咱们大纲里也提到，OpenAI今天不是刚发了一个\"Building abundant intelligence\"的路线图嘛，说要让AI更便宜更普惠——",
      "start": 180.798,
      "duration": 13.429,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，你说这个。这不就是被Qwen、Llama这帮开源选手逼出来的吗？你注意啊，原文那个\"abundant\"用得很有意思，丰沛的、富足的意思。潜台词就是：我承认以前太贵了，现在我要变便宜。",
      "start": 194.691,
      "duration": 17.347,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这反应速度挺快的。而且人家提的是\"全栈路线\"，从芯片到模型到应用都要自己搞。",
      "start": 212.455,
      "duration": 6.966,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是，这就是在抢叙事权嘛。以前大家觉得OpenAI是最聪明的模型提供者，现在发现\"聪明\"这个词被开源追平了，那它就得换故事——变成最完整的AI基础设施提供商。说白了，护城河从模型层下沉到全栈层。",
      "start": 219.857,
      "duration": 16.694,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，那咱们换个话题。说真的，今天第二条新闻我觉得更有意思——DeepMind和Isomorphic Labs联合发了那个\"生物韧性\"路线图。这名字听起来就很玄乎。",
      "start": 236.968,
      "duration": 16.607,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你别被名字唬住。咱们拆开看，Isomorphic Labs是DeepMind旗下的制药公司，这次联合发布的本质就是把AlphaFold那套蛋白质理解能力往外延伸，从\"看懂分子\"升级到\"看懂并增强整个生命系统的韧性\"。",
      "start": 254.071,
      "duration": 18.436,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那具体能干啥？比如说我感冒了，它能给我配个新药？",
      "start": 272.919,
      "duration": 3.788,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没那么直接，但逻辑是通的。生物韧性覆盖三个层面：一个是药物设计，针对疑难靶点加速新药研发；一个是抗生素耐药性，这个现在已经是全球性公共卫生危机了；再一个是生态系统响应，比如珊瑚礁退化、森林病害这种。AI for Science从\"理解分子\"迈向\"增强系统\"，这是质变。",
      "start": 277.186,
      "duration": 24.052,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，我之前看过一个数据说每年因为抗生素耐药性死的人比癌症还多，听着特别吓人。",
      "start": 301.67,
      "duration": 8.054,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是，传统新药研发周期十年起步、烧钱几十亿美金，成功率不到10%。AI介入后，至少在靶点发现和分子筛选这两个环节效率提升是指数级的。这次路线图更激进，直接把视角拉到\"生命系统\"层级，等于在重新定义AI for Science的边界。",
      "start": 310.192,
      "duration": 20.221,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这是不是意味着以后咱们看病的方式都会变？",
      "start": 330.903,
      "duration": 3.744,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "会，但不是一朝一夕。短期内你看到的变化可能是某些罕见病突然有了新药，中期是临床试验效率提升、个性化治疗普及，长期才是真正的\"生命系统增强\"——听着科幻，但路线图已经画出来了。",
      "start": 335.124,
      "duration": 17.391,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好，那说说快讯。微软那个Aurora 1.5你看了没？",
      "start": 352.933,
      "duration": 5.007,
      "audios": {
