      "duration": 18.871,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "明白了，这种基础设施级别的AI更新，平时没感觉，关键时刻能救命。",
      "start": 403.4,
      "duration": 5.442,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，而且你注意啊，Aurora这种模型跟咱们前面聊的Qwen那种不一样，它走的是开放科学路线，数据和论文都公开，本质上是为全球科研社区服务的，不完全是商业产品。",
      "start": 409.329,
      "duration": 14.517,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "最后一条，OpenAI在欧洲的\"责任AI进展\"。这条听起来挺官方的，有什么值得聊的吗？",
      "start": 424.288,
      "duration": 7.967,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "有，而且挺关键。你知道欧盟AI法案是全球第一个全面AI监管框架，2024年8月生效，2026年正好进入实质性合规阶段。OpenAI这次主动公开在欧洲的安全、透明度、溯源实践，等于在监管博弈里从\"被动应对\"转向\"主动示范\"。",
      "start": 432.715,
      "duration": 22.441,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我翻译一下就是——监管落地了，大厂开始表态度了？",
      "start": 455.627,
      "duration": 5.094,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "不只是表态度。你想啊，欧盟市场占全球GDP大概16%，你要是被定性为\"高风险不合规\"，整个市场就进不去了。所以这不是姿态问题，是真金白银的生意问题。OpenAI在抢合规标准的话语权——如果它的实践范式成为欧洲的参考标准，那其他厂商就得跟着它的规则走。",
      "start": 461.133,
